<title>UK: Bayern Hypo sets $200 mln bond due December 1999.</title>
<headline>Bayern Hypo sets $200 mln bond due December 1999.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nomura International and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE HYPOTHEKEN- UND WECHSEL-BANK AG</p>
<p> AMT	  $200 MLN  COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.DEC.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.955   PAY DATE    30.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.88     SPREAD	+20 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/GB DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMNAY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.175     SELL CONC  1.075     PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 6.00 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 30.JUN.99,</p>
<p>			    YIELDING AROUND 6.03 PERCENT.</p>
<p>			    (6.375 PCT U.S. T-NOTE DUE 15.MAY.00 WAS</p>
<p>			    YIELDING AROUND 6.18 PERCENT.)</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
